WEBVTT

1
00:00:02.130 --> 00:00:06.790
Dig out your ugly Christmas sweater because today it's second drink of Christmas party.
翻出你那件丑丑的圣诞毛衣吧，因为今天我们要举办“圣诞第二杯”派对。

2
00:00:07.450 --> 00:00:09.950
Oh, I love this episode so much.
噢，我太喜欢这一集了。

3
00:00:10.090 --> 00:00:11.210
I loved shooting it.
我当时拍得也很开心。

4
00:00:11.390 --> 00:00:12.950
I loved our breakdown of it.
我也很喜欢我们对这一集的拆解分析。

5
00:00:13.050 --> 00:00:18.010
But Angela, you told me you found something crazy in the candy bag alts for this episode.
但是安吉拉，你跟我说你在这一集的备选台词里发现了什么疯狂的东西。

6
00:00:18.130 --> 00:00:18.630
I did.
没错。

7
00:00:19.030 --> 00:00:22.610
So when we first broke down this episode, I didn't check the candy bag alts.
所以当我们第一次拆解这一集时，我没去查那些备选台词。

8
00:00:22.730 --> 00:00:26.790
And I thought this time, you know, I'd go back and see if there was anything I missed.
这次我想，你知道的，回去看看有没有什么我漏掉的东西。

9
00:00:26.910 --> 00:00:28.210
And oh my God, buckle in.
天哪，你可坐稳了。

10
00:00:28.310 --> 00:00:29.090
What is it?
是什么？

11
00:00:29.190 --> 00:00:31.130
You have not told me what is it.
你还没告诉我到底是什么。

12
00:00:31.310 --> 00:00:31.450
No.
还没呢。

13
00:00:31.450 --> 00:00:36.750
So remember, when Michael buys all the vodka for the party, well, Meredith had a talking
还记得迈克尔为派对买光了所有伏特加吗？梅雷迪思当时有个采访镜头。

14
00:00:36.750 --> 00:00:37.470
head about it.
就是关于这事的。

15
00:00:37.590 --> 00:00:38.270
Let's hear it.
我们来听听看。

16
00:00:38.370 --> 00:00:43.350
The deal is that this is my last hurrah because I've made a New Year's resolution that I'm
情况是这样的，这是我最后的狂欢了，因为我立了个新年决心，

17
00:00:43.350 --> 00:00:45.890
not going to drink anymore during the week.
以后工作日期间我再也不喝酒了。

18
00:00:46.270 --> 00:00:46.750
Okay.
好吧。

19
00:00:47.210 --> 00:00:49.350
So there were candy bag alts for that?
所以那段还有备选台词？

20
00:00:49.590 --> 00:00:52.250
Yes, there were several candy bag alts for it.
是的，有好几段备选台词。

21
00:00:52.590 --> 00:00:53.570
Here was one of them.
这是其中之一。

22
00:00:53.950 --> 00:00:56.290
Meredith would have said, yeah, I like to drink.
梅雷迪思本来说的是：没错，我喜欢喝酒。

23
00:00:56.330 --> 00:01:00.110
And if I get too drunk, I'll just have my 14-year-old pick me up.
如果我喝得太醉，我就让我14岁的儿子来接我。

24
00:01:00.110 --> 00:01:01.830
He has his tractor license now.
他现在有拖拉机驾照了。

25
00:01:02.470 --> 00:01:03.030
Oh.
噢。

26
00:01:03.290 --> 00:01:03.530
Mm-hmm.
嗯哼。

27
00:01:03.810 --> 00:01:06.670
I don't quite see how that fits.
我不太明白这怎么能扯上关系。

28
00:01:06.830 --> 00:01:07.230
Mm-hmm.
嗯哼。

29
00:01:07.610 --> 00:01:08.790
But that's not all.
但这还不是全部。

30
00:01:08.950 --> 00:01:09.190
Okay.
好吧。

31
00:01:09.450 --> 00:01:14.650
That candy bag alt led to a candy bag alt tag ending of the episode.
那个备选台词还引出了这一集的一个备选结尾。

32
00:01:14.950 --> 00:01:17.730
Was it her son picking her up on a tractor?
是她儿子开拖拉机来接她吗？

33
00:01:17.730 --> 00:01:19.410
It read like this.
剧本是这样写的。

34
00:01:20.370 --> 00:01:22.110
Exterior Dunder Mifflin night.
外景，邓德·米夫林公司，夜晚。

35
00:01:22.390 --> 00:01:23.430
Shot from inside.
从室内拍摄。

36
00:01:23.750 --> 00:01:25.150
The parking lot is empty.
停车场空无一人。

37
00:01:25.370 --> 00:01:30.990
A giant backhoe rumbles into the parking lot, driven by Meredith's 14-year-old son.
一辆巨大的挖掘机轰隆隆地开进停车场，驾驶员是梅雷迪思14岁的儿子。

38
00:01:31.230 --> 00:01:37.570
We pan over to see a wobbly, still topless Meredith wander out of the building and move
镜头平移，看到摇摇晃晃、依然没穿上衣的梅雷迪思从大楼里走出来，

39
00:01:37.570 --> 00:01:38.690
towards the backhoe.
走向挖掘机。

40
00:01:38.910 --> 00:01:41.430
Meredith's son, mom, what are you doing?
梅雷迪思的儿子问：妈，你在干什么？

41
00:01:41.970 --> 00:01:46.810
She approaches the huge dirt mover thing on the front of the backhoe and starts to climb
她走近挖掘机前端那个巨大的铲斗，开始往里爬。

42
00:01:46.810 --> 00:01:47.190
in it.
爬了进去。

43
00:01:47.490 --> 00:01:50.930
Meredith says, did you remember to put a pillow in the big basket?
梅雷迪思说：你记得在那个大篮子里放个枕头了吗？

44
00:01:51.550 --> 00:01:53.330
Meredith's son says, yes, mom.
梅雷迪思的儿子说：记得，妈。

45
00:01:53.950 --> 00:01:55.670
Meredith gets in and lies down.
梅雷迪思躺了进去。

46
00:01:55.950 --> 00:01:57.530
The backhoe starts to pull away.
挖掘机开始驶离。

47
00:01:58.330 --> 00:01:59.850
Did we shoot that?
我们拍过这个吗？

48
00:02:00.250 --> 00:02:01.810
This is a candy bag alt.
这只是个备选方案。

49
00:02:01.970 --> 00:02:02.710
I don't know.
我不知道。

50
00:02:02.970 --> 00:02:04.290
There's no way we shot it.
我们不可能拍过这个。

51
00:02:04.830 --> 00:02:05.290
Okay.
好吧。

52
00:02:05.830 --> 00:02:06.390
That?
那个？

53
00:02:06.750 --> 00:02:07.310
No.
不。

54
00:02:07.310 --> 00:02:13.350
But if they had picked the candy bag alt talking head, would we have shot this tag?
但如果他们选了糖果袋那个备选访谈片段，我们还会拍这个片尾彩蛋吗？

55
00:02:13.590 --> 00:02:14.650
I, no.
我，不。

56
00:02:14.950 --> 00:02:15.270
No.
不。

57
00:02:15.550 --> 00:02:17.770
This is, the writers, it was late.
这是，编剧们，当时太晚了。

58
00:02:17.950 --> 00:02:19.230
They were punchy.
他们当时很疲惫。

59
00:02:19.410 --> 00:02:20.610
And this is what happened.
然后就发生了这种事。

60
00:02:20.850 --> 00:02:24.470
They're like, Meredith's gonna climb topless into a backhoe?
他们就像是，梅雷迪思要半裸着爬进挖掘机里？

61
00:02:24.590 --> 00:02:24.770
No.
不。

62
00:02:25.070 --> 00:02:25.410
No.
不。

63
00:02:25.730 --> 00:02:25.950
No.
不。

64
00:02:26.290 --> 00:02:27.570
It did not happen.
那没发生过。

65
00:02:27.570 --> 00:02:29.630
But I couldn't believe that when I read it.
但我读到的时候简直不敢相信。

66
00:02:29.810 --> 00:02:34.970
Well, lady, this episode also features the famous Yankee swap, gift exchange.
好吧，女士，这一集还包含了著名的“洋基交换”礼物互换环节。

67
00:02:35.170 --> 00:02:35.310
Yeah.
没错。

68
00:02:35.310 --> 00:02:36.310
People are getting gifts.
大家都在拿礼物。

69
00:02:36.510 --> 00:02:37.550
They're swapping gifts.
他们正在交换礼物。

70
00:02:37.770 --> 00:02:37.930
Yep.
是的。

71
00:02:38.210 --> 00:02:40.210
And we had a fan catch from Elizabeth H.
我们收到了一位粉丝伊丽莎白·H的反馈，

72
00:02:40.450 --> 00:02:43.690
who wrote in to say, in the gift exchange, Jim
她写信来说，在礼物交换环节，吉姆

73
00:02:43.690 --> 00:02:47.590
gets Creed's old shirt but ends up with the Shamrock keychain.
拿到了克里德的旧衬衫，但最后却拿到了三叶草钥匙扣。

74
00:02:47.590 --> 00:02:51.770
So I want to know, who stole Creed's old shirt from Jim?
所以我很想知道，是谁从吉姆那里偷走了克里德的旧衬衫？

75
00:02:52.170 --> 00:02:52.470
Right?
对吧？

76
00:02:52.630 --> 00:02:52.770
Yeah.
没错。

77
00:02:52.770 --> 00:02:55.050
Because that's the only way Jim would get another gift.
因为那是吉姆能拿到另一个礼物的唯一途径。

78
00:02:55.210 --> 00:02:55.630
Exactly.
没错。

79
00:02:56.030 --> 00:03:00.830
Well, Angela, I remember when we recorded this episode, you had just gotten a DVD player
好吧，安吉拉，我记得我们录制这一集的时候，你刚买了一台DVD播放机，

80
00:03:00.830 --> 00:03:03.570
and you could finally watch the deleted scenes.
你终于可以看删减片段了。

81
00:03:03.750 --> 00:03:07.730
And you were so tickled because there was a lot for this episode.
你当时特别高兴，因为这一集有很多删减内容。

82
00:03:07.950 --> 00:03:12.210
And I believe Elizabeth's question is answered in a deleted scene.
我相信伊丽莎白的问题在删减片段里有答案。

83
00:03:12.390 --> 00:03:13.290
It is.
确实有。

84
00:03:13.650 --> 00:03:19.010
So there's a scene with Ryan and Toby where Ryan shares that he got Creed's old shirt.
有一个瑞安和托比的片段，瑞安分享说他拿到了克里德的旧衬衫。

85
00:03:19.210 --> 00:03:22.970
He said, well, you know, I figure I'll just maybe give it to a homeless person.
他说，嗯，你知道，我想我可能会把它给个流浪汉。

86
00:03:22.970 --> 00:03:26.470
Okay, so Ryan stole Creed's shirt from Jim.
好吧，所以是瑞安从吉姆那里偷走了克里德的衬衫。

87
00:03:26.630 --> 00:03:27.450
I guess so.
我想是吧。

88
00:03:27.550 --> 00:03:27.850
Okay.
好吧。

89
00:03:28.090 --> 00:03:32.070
And then there's this great little scene between Oscar and Creed.
然后奥斯卡和克里德之间还有一段很棒的小插曲。

90
00:03:32.950 --> 00:03:34.730
I just loved it, lady.
我太喜欢了，女士。

91
00:03:35.170 --> 00:03:39.110
I know it's not exactly about this question, but I want you to hear it.
我知道这和刚才的问题不完全相关，但我还是想让你听听。

92
00:03:39.190 --> 00:03:39.410
Okay.
好的。

93
00:03:39.710 --> 00:03:40.610
What'd you end up with?
你最后拿到了什么？

94
00:03:40.870 --> 00:03:41.810
Your shower radio.
你的淋浴收音机。

95
00:03:42.230 --> 00:03:43.390
You like music at least?
你至少喜欢音乐吧？

96
00:03:43.790 --> 00:03:44.490
I love it.
我超爱。

97
00:03:44.970 --> 00:03:47.090
I actually used to have a radio show back in the 70s.
其实我在70年代还主持过广播节目呢。

98
00:03:47.630 --> 00:03:48.030
You're kidding.
你开玩笑吧。

99
00:03:48.390 --> 00:03:49.570
What was your DJ name?
你的DJ艺名叫什么？

100
00:03:51.110 --> 00:03:52.270
Wacky Weed Creed.
古怪大麻克里德。

101
00:03:52.910 --> 00:03:54.230
Wait, is that true?
等等，那是真的吗？

102
00:03:54.650 --> 00:03:55.150
All right.
好吧。

103
00:03:55.170 --> 00:03:56.170
Is that a true thing?
那是真的吗？

104
00:03:56.370 --> 00:03:58.370
This is like what I was wondering.
这正是我所好奇的。

105
00:03:58.790 --> 00:04:03.650
So I basically started this just wanting to answer Elizabeth's question.
所以我起初做这件事，纯粹是为了回答伊丽莎白的问题。

106
00:04:03.950 --> 00:04:04.230
Yes.
是的。

107
00:04:04.370 --> 00:04:06.850
And I was like, okay, now I've got to reach out to Creed.
当时我就想，好吧，现在我得联系一下克里德。

108
00:04:07.090 --> 00:04:08.990
I mean, I've got to find this out.
我是说，我必须弄清楚这件事。

109
00:04:09.130 --> 00:04:11.150
So I said, Credo, it's Pumpkin.
所以我说，克里德，我是南瓜。

110
00:04:11.610 --> 00:04:12.850
Random question for you.
问你个随性的问题。

111
00:04:12.950 --> 00:04:14.450
Did you really have a radio show?
你真的做过广播节目吗？

112
00:04:14.590 --> 00:04:16.430
And was your DJ name Wacky Weed Creed?
你的DJ名字是不是叫“古怪大麻克里德”？

113
00:04:16.710 --> 00:04:17.030
And?
然后呢？

114
00:04:17.230 --> 00:04:17.970
He wrote back.
他回信了。

115
00:04:18.090 --> 00:04:18.930
That's so funny.
太搞笑了。

116
00:04:19.050 --> 00:04:20.830
Oscar asked me that on The Office.
奥斯卡在《办公室》里也问过我这个问题。

117
00:04:20.830 --> 00:04:29.700
He thought, oh, no, hon, that was scripted.
他当时想，哦，不，亲爱的，那是剧本写的。

118
00:04:29.800 --> 00:04:33.380
But I did do a Chinese TV show that became very popular over there.
但我确实参加过一个在中国非常受欢迎的电视节目。

119
00:04:33.640 --> 00:04:33.980
Yes.
是的。

120
00:04:34.100 --> 00:04:35.900
He talked about that on the podcaSt.
他在播客里谈到过这件事。

121
00:04:36.460 --> 00:04:38.440
Captain Clark was his character's name.
他角色的名字叫克拉克船长。

122
00:04:38.640 --> 00:04:40.840
So this was all the writers.
所以这些都是编剧写的。

123
00:04:41.160 --> 00:04:42.840
But isn't that a fun nugget?
但这难道不是个有趣的八卦吗？

124
00:04:43.020 --> 00:04:43.580
Very fun.
非常有趣。

125
00:04:43.580 --> 00:04:45.440
And we also find out what Creed got.
而且我们还发现了克里德得到了什么。

126
00:04:45.780 --> 00:04:47.960
Well, this is the thing about the character of Creed.
嗯，这就是克里德这个角色的特点。

127
00:04:48.220 --> 00:04:49.340
The line is blurry.
界限很模糊。

128
00:04:49.620 --> 00:04:49.960
I know.
我知道。

129
00:04:49.960 --> 00:04:50.540
You don't know.
你根本不知道。

130
00:04:50.780 --> 00:04:53.820
Sometimes he said stuff that was really about his real life.
有时候他说的那些话，其实真的是关于他现实生活中的事。

131
00:04:54.000 --> 00:04:54.500
I know.
我知道。

132
00:04:55.100 --> 00:04:58.240
But don't you love that he thought I was asking for real?
但你不觉得他以为我是认真的在问，这一点很可爱吗？

133
00:04:58.460 --> 00:04:58.760
Yes.
是的。

134
00:04:59.000 --> 00:05:02.780
Lastly, lady, I have a really fun fan catch by Kelly N.
最后，女士，我有一个来自凯莉·N的非常有趣的粉丝发现。

135
00:05:02.900 --> 00:05:04.160
It cracked me up.
它把我逗乐了。

136
00:05:04.480 --> 00:05:04.940
Okay.
好的。

137
00:05:05.360 --> 00:05:08.220
So you know, Jenna, as you and I have been rewatching this,
你知道吗，珍娜，当我们一起重温这部剧时，

138
00:05:08.220 --> 00:05:13.140
we have noted that John says D-White instead of Dwight.
我们注意到约翰把“德怀特”念成了“D-White”。

139
00:05:13.280 --> 00:05:15.560
He says D-White like it's two syllables.
他把“D-White”念成了两个音节。

140
00:05:15.740 --> 00:05:15.860
Yes.
是的。

141
00:05:15.940 --> 00:05:16.940
You pointed this out.
你指出了这一点。

142
00:05:17.180 --> 00:05:17.360
Yeah.
没错。

143
00:05:17.860 --> 00:05:23.340
Well, Kelly says in this episode, John says something instead of something.
嗯，凯莉说在这一集里，约翰把某个词念成了另一个词。

144
00:05:23.600 --> 00:05:24.520
He says something?
他说的是“something”吗？

145
00:05:24.960 --> 00:05:25.960
Son-thing.
他说成了“son-thing”。

146
00:05:26.160 --> 00:05:26.400
Okay.
好吧。

147
00:05:26.520 --> 00:05:26.740
Something.
Something。

148
00:05:27.160 --> 00:05:29.320
Well, I looked at the transcript for the episode,
我查了这一集的剧本，

149
00:05:29.480 --> 00:05:32.300
